 [24], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [684.8777465820312, 151.8294677734375], "pos": [6381.68212890625, 2529.36865234375], "widgets_values": ["This is a beautiful, high-resolution portrait of a young woman captured outdoors on a bright, sunny day.\n\n**Subject and Pose:**\nThe central focus is the woman's face and upper body. She is shown in profile, looking slightly upwards and to her right with a serene, contemplative expression. Her head is tilted gently, allowing sunlight to illuminate one side of her face while casting soft shadows across the other. A few strands of hair are caught by the wind, framing her cheek and adding a sense of movement and naturalness to the scene.\n\nHer dark brown hair appears tousled; it’s gathered loosely at the back or top of her head but has wispy tendrils falling around her temples and cheeks. The lighting highlights individual hairs as they catch the sunbeam.\n\nShe wears subtle makeup that enhances her features—softly defined eyebrows, warm-toned eyes (possibly light brown), and glossy coral-red lips that contrast beautifully against her fair skin tone. There's no visible jewelry except for what might be small earrings barely discernible behind her earlobe.\n\n**Attire:**\nShe is dressed in an elegant white garment made from sheer, lightweight fabric such as chiffon or organza. It drapes softly over her shoulders and arms, featuring delicate ruffles along the sleeves and neckline. Intricate embroidery or lace-like patterns can be seen woven into the material, catching the light and giving texture to the otherwise airy dress.\n\n**Setting and Background:**\nThe background consists of a vast open field under a clear blue sky dotted with faint clouds. The grassy terrain stretches out behind her, blurred due to shallow depth-of-field which keeps the viewer focused entirely on her. In the distance, there may be hints of hills or low mountains fading into the horizon.\n\nThe overall atmosphere evokes feelings of freedom, peace, and tranquility—a moment suspended between thoughts, perhaps enjoying nature's quiet beauty beneath a brilliant summer sky.\n\n---\n\nIn summary:\n- **Style:** Cinematic fashion photography.\n- **Mood:** Serene, dreamlike, romantic.\n- **Color Palette:** Soft whites, earthy browns, vibrant greens, deep blues—with golden-hour warmth accentuating every contour.\n- **Lighting:** Natural daylight creating dramatic yet gentle chiaroscuro effects on her face.\n\nIt feels like a carefully composed artistic shot designed to capture both physical grace and emotional stillness."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 22, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [300, 246], "pos": [6755.1337890625, 2221.916748046875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 6, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.76", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [6, 17], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [6768.13818359375, 2073.042724609375], "widgets_values": ["DWPreprocessor", 512], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 20, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "preprocessor"}, "shape": 7, "name": "preprocessor", "label": "preprocessor", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "预处理器"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name"